Package: marknest
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TerraMaster Community Developer <dev@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Installed-Size: 0
Description: MarkNest - Markdown notes for TOS
 A Markdown note library that keeps your notes as ordinary .md files in a
 shared folder on the NAS. Browse, edit and preview them with a split-pane
 editor, search across every note, and reach the same files from the File
 Manager or over SMB.
